l.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250503073424","caption":"На изображении · Такотчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c6/KPTOT86_TakotchiAngel.png/revision/latest?cb=20250503073424"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/84/843ffc88dec18d23231e.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Card_TMGC01-027.jpg","caption":"Tamagotchi Paradise Карточка счастливой коллекции 027"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9.jpeg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d7/Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20251007164930","caption":"Tenshitchi Tamagotchi Карта серии 9","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d7/Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20251007164930"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9_(Back).jpeg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c2/Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9_%28Back%29.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20251007165021","caption":"Tenshitchi Tamagotchi Карта серии 9 (задняя сторона)","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c2/Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9_%28Back%29.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20251007165021"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TakotchiAngel_anim_original.gif","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f4/TakotchiAngel_anim_original.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241210031819","caption":"Анимированный спрайт (Tamagotchi Angel)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Takoten_ttbio.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/ce/Takoten_ttbio.png/revision/latest?cb=20180611195028","caption":"Tamagotchi Изображение профиля города"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/b6/b6c7bb93c1c6911c1702.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:SNESchars.png","caption":"Игра «Налево или направо»","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:QCHAR.BIN(1547)_p00.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/11/QCHAR.BIN%281547%29_p00.png/revision/latest?cb=20210205002719","caption":"Из альбома «Takotchi Angel» · № 27"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TakotchiAngelSprite_App2.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/7e/TakotchiAngelSprite_App2.png/revision/latest?cb=20140404032940","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Takotchi Angel","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TakotchiAngelSprite_App3.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/b4/TakotchiAngelSprite_App3.png/revision/latest?cb=20140404032952","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Takotchi Angel","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TakotchiAngel_Sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d4/TakotchiAngel_Sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20140404152120","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Takotchi Angel","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TakotchiAngel_2024_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/73/TakotchiAngel_2024_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250529145710","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Takotchi Angel","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TakotchiAngel_sprite_SNES.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2f/TakotchiAngel_sprite_SNES.png/revision/latest?cb=20160203024836","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Takotchi Angel","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TakotchiAngelSprite_App1.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/04/TakotchiAngelSprite_App1.png/revision/latest?cb=20140404032928","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Takotchi Angel","sprite":true}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-angel-f944e3","title":"Tamagotchi Angel","ru":"Tamagotchi Angel","kind":"device","note":